# prose_translation = Our subject is the art of poetry itself and its various species, with the specific character of each; the way in which plots should be constructed if the poem is to be successful; the number and nature of its component parts; and similarly all other matters within this field of inquiry. Let us follow the natural order and begin with the primary facts.
# literal_translation = Concerning the poetic art itself and the species of it, what power it has, and how it is necessary to construct plots if poetry ought to hold well, and further from how many and of what sort of parts it is, and similarly also concerning the other things as many as are of the same method, let us speak beginning according to nature first from the first things.
