# prose_translation = Epic poetry and Tragedy, as also Comedy, Dithyrambic poetry, and most flute-playing and lyre-playing, are all, viewed as a whole, modes of imitation.
# literal_translation = Epic poetry therefore and what is tragedy's poetry, further moreover comedy and what is dithyrambic poetry and flute-playing mostly and lyre-playing, all exist being imitations according to the whole;
