# prose_translation = For just as some people imitate many things by depicting them through colors and shapes (some through art, others through practice) and others through voice, so it is in the arts mentioned. All of them effect their imitation in rhythm, speech, and harmony, either separately or mixed together:
# literal_translation = Just as for also by colors and figures many things imitate some assimilating these indeed through art, these however through custom, others however through voice, so also by said arts. In all indeed they make imitation in rhythm and speech and harmony, in these however either separately or mixed:
