# prose_translation = Wherefore in one respect Sophocles would be the same kind of imitator as Homer, for both imitate noble people; but in another respect, as Aristophanes, for both imitate agents who act and perform.
# literal_translation = Wherefore in this indeed same certainly will be imitator to-Homer Sophocles, imitate for both noble-ones; in this however to-Aristophanes, acting-ones for imitate and performing-ones both.
