# prose_translation = Since recognition is a recognition of certain persons, some consist of one person recognizing the other only, when it is already clear who the other is; but sometimes both must recognize each other, as Iphigenia was recognized by Orestes through the sending of the letter, but another recognition was required for him to be known by Iphigenia.
