# prose_translation = What is actually taking place confirms this: at first poets enumerated any chance stories, but now the finest tragedies are composed around a few houses—such as about Alcmaeon, Oedipus, Orestes, Meleager, Thyestes, Telephus, and all others who happened either to suffer terrible things or to have done them.
# literal_translation = Sign moreover and which becomes; first indeed for poets contingent plots were-enumerating, now moreover around few fitting best tragedies are-composed, for-instance around Alcmaeon and Oedipus and Orestes and Meleager and Thyestes and Telephus and whosoever others happened either to-suffer dire-things or to-have-done.
