# prose_translation = For from the knowledge or ignorance of these matters no criticism worthy of serious attention is brought against the poetic art. For why should anyone think that Homer committed a fault in what Protagoras censures, when, believing he is praying, he commands: "Sing, goddess, the wrath"? For to command someone to do or not do something, says Protagoras, is an order.
